<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-07T20:22:20.183Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 20:22:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Manipur security forces including police, CRPF, BSF, Assam Rifles and the army have launched search operations and hold fortnightly security review meetings after a gunfight in Kangpokpi and a rally in Ukhrul demanding an end to ethnic violence and the SoO pact. In Kashmir a blast at a police outpost in Ghaziabad was claimed by a Kashmir-linked outfit, prompting an ATS probe, while IGP Sujit Kumar noted a single local terrorist remains active. Naxalites in the Bastar Maoist belt dumped 900 detonators and electronic equipment. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Lokmat Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTFBlSGpUQVgyQjRQdWd1NWJHOWFFc0V2czJrVmZwTk9heU1KQUowUGIwVjhEbDRNTTdWdEZyWjVBbURXX1ZqUEpwZ1VId3k5UEh2QVpzemxSMHpQRjFvakIyY29wOV9qbDBheXJPakdtOWlQT1BYc205bDhB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kashmir Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Asianet Newsable&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Madhyamam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQN1dFd1VoOGhzUDRocmZ0ajlidGxMOVdmQUlzeU53WDdpb3JJbUFKOEt6bzIxdS1rclJyVW9TMXhWZkRibUxwak9oVmJjRE9EZGtaaTdOZjlXNVQ5dkY2eGtjNkR5cWNiWEFSbHR5ekJwUFFMaGxJekVJWnlwajZVZmhRNWktc1NoSGNsbFFJMjU5YjEwTkxpTV9BZXJPdEZScElST2ZOdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;IANS LIVE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi--?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;